</NameTag>
```

This _feels_ like it should be fine because, with implicit children, the variables _seem like_ they are scoped to the component block. It's also a refactoring hazard because starting out with `children()` and then later expanding props to include other snippets means you need to move the variable declarations to the `<script>` tag.

